SUMMARY:AI Hacks and Hops - From Chatbot to Co-Worker: AI for Business
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**From Chatbot to Co-Worker: A Business Gu
 ide to AI That Actually Works**\n**Speaker:** [Julio Barros](https://www.l
 inkedin.com/in/juliobarros/)\n\n**Description:** Most business owners use 
 AI the way people used the internet in 1996\, they check the weather. They
  type questions into ChatGPT\, read the answer\, and close the tab. Meanwh
 ile\, a quiet revolution is underway: small teams are using AI agents to r
 un real business operations\, following up with leads\, generating reports
 \, managing content pipelines\, and handling customer support autonomously
 .\nThe gap between "asking AI questions" and "giving AI a job" is the bigg
 est competitive window most of us will see in our careers. But closing tha
 t gap wrong is worse than not closing it at all.\nThis session walks you t
 hrough the progression from chatbot to co-worker with live demonstrations\
 , then gives you a practical framework for identifying where to start in y
 our own business - and what order to do it in so you don't automate the wr
 ong thing first.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a monthly
  event tailored for non-technical professionals\, entrepreneurs\, marketer
 s\, engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore and discuss how to use AI.\
 n\nEach gathering will feature presentations\, stimulating group discussio
 ns\, and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite brews while delvi
 ng into the world of AI. Topics will range from AI integration in business
  processes\, marketing\, content creation\, software\, ethical considerati
 ons\, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to the latest advancements in AI
  technology. The informal setting encourages open dialogue\, idea exchange
 \, and fosters a collaborative spirit.
