  our small group size and directed discussions. This intimate setting allo
 ws for deeper\, more engaging conversations where everyone's voice can be 
 heard. It's the perfect environment for those who love to dive deep into t
 hemes\, characters\, and the intricacies of storytelling.\n\nSo whether yo
